Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue — that was wrong.** The export shows **two causes** under this ticket:
`parser` (379) and `hint` (33). See [two problems under one known](/kb/incidents/4471-problems).

<Callout>
Not one known bug. Split into one ticket per cause before the fix queue.
